[00:13.909]I don't wanna be left behind
{"我不想被抛在后面"}
[00:16.349]
[00:18.200]Distance was a friend of mine
{"距离曾是我的朋友"}
[00:20.180]
[00:22.299]Catching breath in a web of lies
{"在谎言的网中喘口气"}
[00:24.0]
[00:24.939]I've spent most of my life
{"我大半辈子都在"}
[00:29.340]Riding waves, playing acrobat
{"乘风破浪，像杂技演员"}
[00:31.209]
[00:33.40]Shadowboxing the other half
{"与另一半影子搏斗"}
[00:35.660]
[00:36.910]Learning how to react
{"学习如何反应"}
[00:39.800]
[00:40.310]I've spent most of my time
{"我大部分时间都在"}
[00:44.620]
[00:45.210]Catching my breath,
{"喘口气，"}
[00:47.80]letting it go,
{"随它去，"}
[00:49.10]turning my cheek for the sake of this show
{"为了这场戏而转过脸去"}
[00:53.120]Now that you know,
{"现在你知道了，"}
[00:54.800]this is my life,
{"这就是我的生活，"}
[00:56.700]I won't be told what's supposed to be right
{"我不会被告知什么才是对的"}
