[01:18.370]
[01:19.700]Heavy heart, now a weightless cloud
{"沉重的心，如今是轻盈的云"}
[01:21.820]
[01:23.400]Making time for the ones that count
{"为重要的人留出时间"}
[01:26.40]
[01:26.870]I'll spend the rest of my time
